'''Divinity''' is a [[buff]] granted by {{il|Garb of the Ephemeral}}.

==Mechanics==
Divinity grants 20% increased [[character size]], 75% more [[elemental damage]], 25% less [[elemental damage]] taken, and immunity to [[curse]]s.<ref name="Announcement"/> Divinity duration cannot be modified.
